*> vybe-test: cobol/arrays/indexed_array_assignments_compile
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_arrays.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TABLE PIC 9(3) OCCURS 3 TIMES.
01 WS-INDEX PIC 9(1) VALUE 1.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 10 TO WS-TABLE(1).
    MOVE 20 TO WS-TABLE(2).
    MOVE 30 TO WS-TABLE(3).
    DISPLAY WS-TABLE(1).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-TABLE(1) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "10"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [10] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-TABLE(2).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-TABLE(2) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "20"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [20] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-TABLE(3).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-TABLE(3) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "30"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [30] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

